{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54742","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵要法（京本作「诀」），爲主认星辰。\n伏逆迟留（京本作「留时」）须固守，更看金（京本作「堪全」）现便（京本作「使」）宜行，俱伏两均平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}